#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: sm-trade.php
msgid "SM Trade"
msgstr "SM Commandes et offres"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: sm-trade.php
msgid "https://github.com/fdebbi/steel-marketplace"
msgstr "https://github.com/fdebbi/steel-marketplace"

#. Description of the plugin
#: sm-trade.php
msgid ""
"Orders and offers between buyers and sellers: \"Buy\" at the listed price "
"(whole lot or a quantity), \"Make an offer\" with counter-offers, acceptance"
" by the seller, stock taken from the listing, contact details shared once "
"accepted, history for the buyer, the seller and the administration (CSV "
"export). Payment and delivery are settled directly between buyer and seller."
" Requires SM Core and SM Products 0.10.0."
msgstr ""
"Commandes et offres entre acheteurs et vendeurs : « Acheter » au prix "
"affiché (tout le lot ou une quantité), « Faire une offre » avec contre-"
"offres, acceptation par le vendeur, stock retiré de l’annonce, coordonnées "
"partagées après acceptation, historique pour l’acheteur, le vendeur et "
"l’administration (export CSV). Le paiement et la livraison se règlent "
"directement entre acheteur et vendeur. Nécessite SM Core et SM Products "
"0.10.0."

#. Author of the plugin
#: sm-trade.php
msgid "ReuSteel"
msgstr "ReuSteel"

